// Check for Cubie A5E firmware updates after every successful `apt update`.
// Never blocks or fails the apt run: the check is bounded by `timeout 30`, its
// output is informational, and `|| true` swallows the exit status. Drops the
// old `su ... -c` wrapper because apt already runs as root and PAM sessions
// are slow and noisy in a container/chroot.
APT::Update::Post-Invoke-Success {
  "timeout 30 /usr/bin/cubie-ota check --apt || true";
};
